.TH mnnn-org-edit 1  "mnnn-org-edit 2.16.0" 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH NAME
mnnn\-org\-edit \- Change an organization
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmnnn org edit\fR [\fB\-\-home\fR] [\fB\-\-name\fR] [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-slug\fR] [\fB\-\-description\fR] [\fB\-\-non\-interactive\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR]... [\fB\-\-visibility\fR] [\fB\-\-access\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-\-hosted\fR] [\fB\-y\fR|\fB\-\-yes\fR] [\fB\-\-member\-auth\fR] [\fB\-\-theme\-mode\fR] [\fB\-\-gated\fR] [\fB\-\-template\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIORG\fR> 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH DESCRIPTION
Change an organization
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-home\fR \fI<DIR>\fR
Muninn home directory (default ~/.muninn)
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_HOME\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-name\fR \fI<NAME>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Database file (default <home>/storage/muninn.database)
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_DB\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-slug\fR \fI<SLUG>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-description\fR \fI<DESCRIPTION>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-non\-interactive\fR
Never prompt; missing values are errors
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_NON_INTERACTIVE\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
More output (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-\-visibility\fR \fI<VISIBILITY>\fR
public or private
.TP
\fB\-\-access\fR \fI<ACCESS>\fR
members or open
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Print nothing but errors and requested data
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_QUIET\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-hosted\fR \fI<on|off>\fR
Serve its site with `mnnn org host start`
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
on
.IP \(bu 2
off
.RE
.TP
\fB\-y\fR, \fB\-\-yes\fR
Answer yes to every confirmation
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_YES\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-member\-auth\fR \fI<on|off>\fR
Members may sign web requests with their exchange key
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
on
.IP \(bu 2
off
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-theme\-mode\fR \fI<THEME_MODE>\fR
Override the theme mode for this run
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
light
.IP \(bu 2
dark
.IP \(bu 2
system
.RE
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_THEME_MODE\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-gated\fR \fI<on|off>\fR
A private org\*(Aqs site shows guests a landing, sign\-in and join page
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
on
.IP \(bu 2
off
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-template\fR \fI<TEMPLATE>\fR
The site template (a template name, or `default`)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIORG\fR>

.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH VERSION
v2.16.0
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBmnnn\fR(1)
